# size-ratchet exclusion list — binary, generated, and append-only log content
# only. Hand-written source is never excluded; oversized source is frozen in
# size-ratchet-baseline.tsv.
# Format: pattern<TAB>reason (shell glob against the full repo-relative path; * crosses /).

*.lock	lockfile (Cargo.lock, flake.lock) — generated by the package manager, size is not a design signal
*package-lock.json	npm lockfile — generated by npm
pi-extensions/pi-claude-bridge/bundle/*.js	esbuild output — built from src/ by `npm run build`, reproduced by CI
pi-extensions/*/assets/*	extension screenshots and demo recordings (png/gif/mp4) — binary media
docs/assets/*	documentation screenshots and renders — binary/exported media
skills/iced-rs/examples/*.png	vendored upstream iced example images — binary
skills/iced-rs/examples/*.jpg	vendored upstream iced example textures — binary
skills/iced-rs/examples/*.gif	vendored upstream iced example recordings — binary
skills/iced-rs/examples/*.ttf	vendored upstream iced example fonts — binary
CHANGELOG.md	append-only release log — grows every PR by design; its seam is release rotation, not a code split
ui/src/bindings.ts	generated by tauri-specta — regenerated from Rust types, never hand-edited
ui/src/components/ui/*	shadcn-generated UI primitives — vendored generated code
docs/img/*	README screenshots and the tour gif — binary media
